員幫我加的麵改粗麵，但送來幾乎看不出來不一樣，吃時才有感覺有些微差異。\n內用還能飲料無限暢飲，有四種口味能選，令我意外的是有少見的可爾必思，感覺不錯，另外還能吃一份冰淇淋，今天的是香草口味，品質還行。\n整體吃下來還不錯，下次經過想吃拉麵時會再訪。",null,[0,206]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKZEZScVdYcFhSR2hEVFZWWk5XUXlTakZTYTJSVFZqQjRNMlZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKZEZScVdYcFhSR2hEVFZWWk5XUXlTakZTYTJSVFZqQjRNMlZ1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKZEZScVdYcFhSR2hEVFZWWk5XUXlTakZTYTJSVFZqQjRNMlZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKZEZScVdYcFhSR2hEVFZWWk5XUXlTakZTYTJSVFZqQjRNMlZ1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKZEZScVdYcFhSR2hEVFZWWk5XUXlTakZTYTJSVFZqQjRNMlZ1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKZEZScVdYcFhSR2hEVFZWWk5XUXlTakZTYTJSVFZqQjRNMlZ1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1467,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JdFRqWXpXRGhDTVVZNWQySjFSa2RTVjB4M2VuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xaa0472569fa0a08e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnItTjYzWDhCMUY5d2J1RkdSV0x3enc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JdFRqWXpXRGhDTVVZNWQySjFSa2RTVjB4M2VuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JdFRqWXpXRGhDTVVZNWQySjFSa2RTVjB4M2VuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JdFRqWXpXRGhDTVVZNWQySjFSa2RTVjB4M2VuYxILMGUybXRENnBZMFgaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09uSXRUall6V0RoQ01VWTVkMkoxUmtkU1YweDNlbmMSCzBlMm10RDZwWTBYIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARjqCgn1Z