n\n飲料機有四種口味，另有普通冰開水。\n霜淇淋目前是香草，品質與口感也算是不錯吃的。\n\n可以用電子支付，有台灣Pay 跟 LINE Pay。\n\n其中有個男店員，五官深邃、鼻樑很挺很高，man man 的很帥，態度也不錯。",null,[0,47]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrTldSRk1YQlZNVGxOWVRGV1VGRlhOVFJoTTAwMVZXeEplR0p1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrTldSRk1YQlZNVGxOWVRGV1VGRlhOVFJoTTAwMVZXeEplR0p1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrTldSRk1YQlZNVGxOWVRGV1VGRlhOVFJoTTAwMVZXeEplR0p1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrTldSRk1YQlZNVGxOWVRGV1VGRlhOVFJoTTAwMVZXeEplR0p1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrTldSRk1YQlZNVGxOWVRGV1VGRlhOVFJoTTAwMVZXeEplR0p1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9899592516577488693/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrTldSRk1YQlZNVGxOWVRGV1VGRlhOVFJoTTAwMVZXeEplR0p1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,1282,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kNWRFMXBVMTlNYTFWUFFXNTRhM001VWxJeGJuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xaa0472569fa0a08e!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmd5dE1pU19Ma1VPQW54a3M5UlIxbnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kNWRFMXBVMTlNYTFWUFFXNTRhM001VWxJeGJuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kNWRFMXBVMTlNYTFWUFFXNTRhM001VWxJeGJuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kNWRFMXBVMTlNYTFWUFFXNTRhM001VWxJeGJuYxILMGRodEd0ajVoR1IaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tZDVkRTFwVTE5TWExVlBRVzU0YTNNNVVsSXhibmMSCzBkaHRHdGo1aEdSIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARjqCgn1ZyBKoqCzBka